      ],
      "en": "Now in the fourteenth year of King Hezekiah, Sennacherib king of Assyria attacked all of the fortified cities of Judah and captured them.",
      "ko": "히스기야왕 십 사년에 앗수르 왕 산헤립이 올라와서 유다 모든 견고한 성을 쳐서 취하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "1f1d61fe084973969276caae51a5bfaf6d98fbd4b16eb97f083a51d354dc5eb5",
      "translation_text_hash": "621e7c967a535e762050c6418c1dedd32c76b228dfefcc84543cfddf8dc8bff5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "히스기야왕 십 사년에 앗수르 왕 산헤립이 올라와서 유다 모든 견고한 성을 쳐서 취하니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "621e7c967a535e762050c6418c1dedd32c76b228dfefcc84543cfddf8dc8bff5"
      ]
