      "en": "Then Rabshakeh stood, and called out with a loud voice in the Jews’ language, and said, “Hear the words of the great king, the king of Assyria!",
      "ko": "이에 랍사게가 일어서서 유다 방언으로 크게 외쳐 가로되 너희는 대왕 앗수르 왕의 말씀을 들으라",
      "source_text_hash": "400e72c2c2c0237418437fd8d1d71321f297d3dc0888b477b2ab907b7d32ee24",
      "translation_text_hash": "fec31ec25b32c7c4d9dbb7ce75283641a607ab56404b694f91dfd38555307456",
